{"kind": "mod", "id": 496, "name": "Baba Yaga", "slug": "baba-yaga", "teaser": "Kill people, make money", "owner_name": "trap", "downloads": 15880, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:36.000000Z", "created_at": "2022-07-02T11:36:57.000000Z", "published_at": "2022-07-02T11:36:57.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "2.2.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>Please backup your profile before using new mods!</strong></p>\n<p>The quests will be given by <strong>Fence</strong> (this is configurable)</p>\n<h2><strong>Installation requirements</strong></h2>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/588-custom-quests/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>Custom Quests</em></a> (&gt;= v3.2.0) should be installed.</p>\n<p>This mod add 2 real repeatable quests (not daily quests) for fence trader:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Kill contracts: kill 10 guys and earn money</li>\n<li>Dogtags collector: give 10 dogtags and earn money + 1 <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.com/wiki/GP_coin\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GP coin</a> + increase fence loyalty (also called scav karma).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Real repeatable quests</strong> means once you completed a quest, <strong>you can</strong> <strong>restart it directly</strong>.</p>\n<h2><strong>Configuration</strong></h2>\n<p>In config/config.json file:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>kill contracts and dogtags collector quests can be disabled independently</li>\n<li>number of needed kills and needed dogtags are configurable (these are the requirements to complete the quest one time)</li>\n<li>rewards are configurable (xp, money, gp coins)</li>\n<li>the trader who gives you a certain quest (work also with modded traders)</li>\n<li>a target field for kill contracts can be “all”, “pmc” or “scav”</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>Credits</strong></h2>\n<p>Thanks to vasyliev_m_s for the russian translations</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/trapcodien\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png\" alt=\"kofi2.png\" /></a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "2.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 345, "published_at": "2024-08-19T17:16:41.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/496/baba-yaga/2.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.2.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 439, "published_at": "2024-08-19T22:51:29.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/496/baba-yaga/2.2.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.2.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3629, "published_at": "2024-08-20T15:43:23.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/496/baba-yaga/2.2.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["guillaumearm/SPT_BabaYaga"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/guillaumearm/SPT_BabaYaga", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}